        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "BREAKING: Germany’s transport minister pushes for Tesla FSD approval across Europe.\n\nSpeaking today at a Tagesspiegel Background conference in Berlin, Steffen Bilger said:\n\n• He will push for Tesla FSD Supervised to reach drivers across the EU soon.\n\n• He sees potential for FSD to make roads safer and wants to support innovation.\n\n• Germany should explore its own approval route if EU talks fail.\n\n• He will work to ensure that this system can be used throughout Europe soon.\n\n📸 Lena Ganssmann / Tagesspiegel",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2107464215984517307",
        "verified": true,
